{"speciesId":524,"names":{"fr":"Nodulithe","es":"Roggenrola","en":"Roggenrola","ja":"ダンゴロ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il a une oreille hexagonale. Son corps, compressé dans des strates profondes, est dur comme de l’acier."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its ear is hexagonal in shape. Compressed underground, its body is as hard as steel."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On l’a découvert dans une fissure après un grand tremblement de terre il y a 100 ans. Il possède un noyau d’énergie."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They were discovered a hundred years ago in an earthquake fissure. Inside each one is an energy core."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The hexagonal-shaped hole is its ear. It has a tendency to walk in the direction the sound is coming from."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The hexagonal-shaped hole is its ear. It has a tendency to walk in the direction the sound is coming from."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il a une oreille hexagonale. Son corps, compressé dans des strates profondes, est dur comme de l’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su oreja tiene forma hexagonal. Su cuerpo fue comprimido bajo tierra. Por eso, es duro como el acero."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its ear is hexagonal in shape. Compressed underground, its body is as hard as steel."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"６角形の 耳を 持つ。 地底で 圧縮された 体は 鉄に 負けないくらい 硬い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On l’a découvert dans une fissure après un grand tremblement de terre il y a 100 ans. Il possède un noyau d’énergie."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Descubierto en unas grietas generadas por un terremoto hace 100 años. Tiene un núcleo energético en su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They were discovered a hundred years ago in an earthquake fissure. Inside each one is an energy core."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"１００年前の 大地震のときに 地割れから 発見された。 体内に エネルギーコアを 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il a une oreille hexagonale. Son corps, compressé dans des strates profondes, est dur comme de l’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Su oreja tiene forma hexagonal. Su cuerpo fue comprimido bajo tierra. Por eso, es duro como el acero."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Its ear is hexagonal in shape. Compressed underground, its body is as hard as steel."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"６角形の 耳を 持つ。 地底で 圧縮された 体は 鉄に 負けないくらい 硬い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On l’a découvert dans une fissure après un grand tremblement de terre il y a 100 ans. Il possède un noyau d’énergie."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Descubierto en unas grietas generadas por un terremoto hace 100 años. Tiene un núcleo energético en su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They were discovered a hundred years ago in an earthquake fissure. Inside each one is an energy core."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"１００年前の 大地震のときに 地割れから 発見された。 体内に エネルギーコアを 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ce Pokémon est né dans les entrailles de la terre. Il adore comparer sa solidité à celle de ses amis, Racaillou et Strassie."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Nació en las profundidades subterráneas. Siempre se compara con sus compañeros Geodude y Carbink para ver quién es más duro."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Born deep within the ground, it compares itself with similar species, such as Geodude and Carbink, to settle which has the hardest body."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"地中の 奥深くで 生まれた。 近い 仲間の イシツブテや メレシーと 硬さ比べをする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"La cavité hexagonale qu’il arbore est son oreille. Il se précipite vers tout ce qu’il entend, mais perd l’équilibre et chute dès que le son s’arrête."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"La cavidad hexagonal es su oído. Camina hacia donde se emite cualquier sonido, pero si este cesa pierde el equilibrio y cae al suelo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The hexagonal cavity is its ear. It walks in the direction of sounds it hears, but if the sounds cease, it panics and topples over."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"六角形の 空洞は 耳。 音が 鳴るほうへ 歩いていくが 音が 止むと 困って 転ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sa cavité hexagonale est une oreille. Il se met en colère si l’on tente d’y plonger la main, car c’est là que se trouve son noyau d’énergie."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El agujero con forma de hexágono es su oído, y en su interior cuenta con un núcleo de energía, por lo que se enfurece si meten la mano dentro."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The hexagonal hole is its ear. Deep in that ear is an energy core, so if you stick your hand in there, Roggenrola will be very angry!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"六角形の 穴は 耳。 耳の 奥には エネルギーコアが あるので 手を 突っ込むと 怒りだすぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce Pokémon a été découvert dans une faille rocheuse. La terre qui constitue son corps remonte à plusieurs centaines d’années."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Fue descubierto entre las grietas de una falla. Su cuerpo está compuesto por una tierra que data de cientos de años."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It was found in a fissure in a layer of exposed rock. The material that makes up its body is dirt from several hundred years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"地割れの 断層から 見つかった。 身体を 構成する 成分は 何百年も 前の 土だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Son corps est aussi dur que le fer, mais si on le laisse longtemps dans l’eau, il paraît qu’il ramollit légèrement."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su cuerpo es casi tan duro como el acero, pero al parecer puede reblandecerse levemente si permanece sumergido en agua mucho tiempo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It’s as hard as steel, but apparently a long soak in water will cause it to soften a bit."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"鉄と 同じくらい 硬いが 長く 水に 浸かっていると ちょっと 軟らかくなるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se déplace en réagissant aux sons environnants. Son noyau d’énergie rend son corps légèrement chaud au toucher."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se dirige hacia cualquier sonido que perciba. Es ligeramente cálido al tacto, debido al efecto de su núcleo energético."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"When it detects a noise, it starts to move. The energy core inside it makes this Pokémon slightly warm to the touch."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"音に 反応し 動きだす。 エネルギーコアの 影響で 触ると すこし 温かい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":524,"moves":[{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",7],[14,"level-up",7],[15,"level-up",7],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[11,"level-up",10],[14,"level-up",10],[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"harden","learns":[[11,"leve